OL,3,GNEWSA'I was angry at my husband - I
OL,4,Adidn't know he had dementia'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Beaumont spent years arguing with
OL,7,Fher husband before realising he had a
OL,8,Fterminal illness.
OL,10,FHelen, who lives in Manchester, married
OL,11,FClive when she was 21 and the couple
OL,12,Fhad their two children two decades
OL,13,Flater.
OL,15,FWhile she expected parenthood to change
OL,16,Fthings - when elements of Clive's
OL,17,Fpersonality appeared to shift she spent
OL,18,Fyears frustrated.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
